{"id":"94cf422187df8d8e","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Interior","display":"df-zfc-top5-interior — ZFC Top5 Interior","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-interior","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-interior"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-interior — ZFC Top5 Interior","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-interior"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-interior</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-interior — ZFC Top5 Interior"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,I\">\\(X,\\tau,A,I\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S\\)</span> (open set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"473439958a92cf5b\" href=\"?note=473439958a92cf5b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-open-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,A,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land I=\\bigcup\\{U\\subseteq A\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,A,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land I=\\bigcup\\{U\\subseteq A\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The interior is the union of all open subsets of the given set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-open-set","status":"resolved","id":"473439958a92cf5b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S$ (open set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-open-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,A,I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}interior} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,A,I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land I=\\bigcup\\{U\\subseteq A\\mid\\mathrm{ZfcTop5OpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":911,"backlinks":[{"id":"dccb6e9ef4cd5373","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S\\subseteq V^4$（参数顺序均为“载体、拓扑、输入集、输出集”，see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]、[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]]）"},{"id":"9198a4b832ce065f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]])"},{"id":"fb8c84fc67a63623","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"00b8e7b7531f5138","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (canonical interior predicate, see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3592","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md|58-df-zfc-top5-interior]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["473439958a92cf5b","74086485fba8d86f"]}